    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MCF Job Alert Extraction Workflow\n\n**Purpose:** Extract job posting data from MyCareersFuture email alerts and store in Google Sheets for analysis.\n\n**Trigger:** Manual\n**Source:** Gmail (job-alerts@mycareersfuture.gov.sg)\n**Output:** Google Sheets (\"MCF Job Data\" spreadsheet)\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Create Google Sheet (disable after first run to reuse)\n2. Fetch emails from Gmail\n3. Extract job UUIDs from email links\n4. Batch API requests by email ID\n5. Fetch job details from MCF API\n6. Transform, deduplicate, and save to Sheets\n\n**Pre-requisites:**\n- Gmail OAuth2 credentials configured\n- Google Sheets OAuth2 credentials configured",
        "height": 512,
        "width": 400
      },
