        -32
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MCF Jobs API (Swagger v2)\n\n**Endpoint:** GET https://api.mycareersfuture.gov.sg/v2/jobs\n**Auth:** None required (public API)\n**Query Params:**\n- `uuids` (array, repeated): Job UUIDs to fetch\n- `limit` (int, 1-100, default 20): Max results\n- `page` (int, default 0): Page number\n**Response:** `{ results: Job[], total: int }`\n**Array format:** Repeated params (`uuids=x&uuids=y`)\n\nURL is built per email batch in the Code node upstream.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 432
      },
